---
Sign out: ends this CLI session on the server and removes the stored login.
An API token is only forgotten here, revoke it with 'hn tokens revoke'.

Usage: hn logout [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn logout
  hn -p work logout
